                                            "with the"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "532304ee-c2c5-4d01-931c-4bfa16a3f88d",
                                                "sense_id": "d7e300ad-ba24-34c7-bd6c-bba6171580bf",
                                                "text": "To the west the Afghan plateau undergoes a very considerable depression, at the bottom of which lies the marshy lake, Hamoun, into which the Helmand river finds its way; but it again rises in the vast plains which lead towards Farsistan."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
