                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A province of Afghanistan, named after the river."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0724fe90-456e-462c-ba48-dc5653321341",
                                                "sense_id": "2b4aac1c-e342-37bb-bca7-2b69d42028a4",
                                                "text": "Since late July, the Taliban have seized new territory across Helmand, defying a series of about 30 US airstrikes, and raising concern of an attack on the capital."
